# Canonical static device nodes for the Phase 3 real BusyBox initramfs.
# Format: <relpath> <c|b> <major> <minor> <mode-octal>
# Encoded deterministically by scripts/pycpio.py (no root required).
# These nodes provide clean initial stdio (/dev/console) and /dev/null
# before userspace mounts devtmpfs; devtmpfs overlays /dev at runtime.
dev/console c 5 1 600
dev/null c 1 3 666
